# mbsync config (password pulled from pass)
IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
Port 993
User pengsteam16@gmail.com
PassCmd "pass show mail/gmail-app-password"
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

MaildirStore gmail-local
Path ~/.mail/gmail/
Inbox ~/.mail/gmail/INBOX
Subfolders Verbatim

Channel gmail
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
Patterns * !"[Gmail]/Trash" !"[Gmail]/All Mail"
Create Near
Expunge Both
SyncState *
